---
// 右侧目录栏 (On this page) 下方的 X2Post 宣发卡片, 所有文章详情页统一展示。
---

<div class="x2post-cta">
  <img
    src="/x2post.svg"
    alt="X2Post"
    class="x2post-logo"
    width="56"
    height="56"
  />
  <div class="x2post-text">
    <p class="x2post-title">X2Post 社区</p>
    <p class="x2post-desc">认真分享 · 友善讨论</p>
  </div>
  <a
    href="https://x2post.com"
    target="_blank"
    rel="noopener noreferrer"
    class="x2post-button"
  >
    去社区看看
  </a>
</div>

<style>
  .x2post-cta {
    border: 1px solid var(--sl-color-text-accent);
    border-radius: 0.5rem;
    padding: 0.5rem;
    background-color: var(--sl-color-gray-6);
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    align-items: center;
    text-align: center;
    gap: 0.75rem;
  }

  .x2post-logo {
    width: 3rem;
    height: 3rem;
    border-radius: 0.5rem;
  }

  .x2post-text {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 0.25rem;
    width: 100%;
  }

  .x2post-title {
    color: var(--sl-color-text);
    font-size: var(--sl-text-h5);
    margin: 0;
    font-weight: 700;
  }

  .x2post-desc {
    color: var(--sl-color-text);
    font-size: var(--sl-text-sm);
    margin: 0;
  }

  .x2post-button {
    background: var(--sl-color-text-accent);
    color: var(--sl-color-black);
    text-decoration: none;
    padding: 0.5rem 1.25rem;
    border-radius: 2rem;
    font-weight: 600;
    text-align: center;
    transition: transform 0.2s ease, box-shadow 0.2s ease;
    font-size: var(--sl-text-base);
    min-width: 100%;
  }

  .x2post-button:hover {
    transform: translateY(-2px);
    box-shadow: 0 10px 15px -3px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.1),
      0 4px 6px -2px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.05);
  }
</style>
